{"task_id": "Mbpp/68", "solution": "from typing import List, Union\ndef is_Monotonic(array: List[Union[int, float]]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if an array is monotonic (either non-increasing or non-decreasing).\n    An array is monotonic if its elements are consistently increasing or decreasing.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(array) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    can_increase = True\n    can_decrease = True\n\n    for i in range(len(array) - 1):\n        if array[i] < array[i+1]:\n            can_decrease = False\n        elif array[i] > array[i+1]:\n            can_increase = False\n        \n        # If both possibilities are false, it's not monotonic, so we can exit early.\n        if not can_increase and not can_decrease:\n            return False\n\n    return can_increase or can_decrease"}
