{"task_id": "Mbpp/420", "solution": "def cube_Sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of cubes of the first n even natural numbers using a closed-form formula.\"\"\"\n    # The sum is given by 2 * (n * (n + 1)) ** 2\n    return 2 * (n * (n + 1)) ** 2"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    # Calculate the sum of the first n natural numbers using the formula n*(n+1)/2.\n    sum_of_first_n_natural_numbers = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    # The sum of the cubes of the first n natural numbers is the square of this sum.\n    sum_of_cubes = sum_of_first_n_natural_numbers * sum_of_first_n_natural_numbers\n    \n    # Calculate the average by dividing the sum of cubes by n.\n    average = sum_of_cubes / n\n    return average"}
