{"task_id": "Mbpp/430", "solution": "def parabola_directrix(a, b, c):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the directrix (y-value) of a parabola given its coefficients\n    in the form y = a x^2 + b x + c.\n    \"\"\"\n    # The directrix for a parabola y = ax^2 + bx + c is given by y = c - (b^2 + 1) / (4a)\n    directrix_y = c - (b**2 + 1) / (4 * a)\n    return directrix_y"}
