{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "import math\ndef sumofFactors(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all even factors of a given positive integer n.\"\"\"\n    factors = set()\n    total_even_factors_sum = 0\n    \n    # Iterate from 1 up to the square root of n to find all factors.\n    limit = int(math.isqrt(n))\n\n    for i in range(1, limit + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            factors.add(i)\n            factors.add(n // i)\n            \n    # Sum up only the even factors found.\n    for factor in factors:\n        if factor % 2 == 0:\n            total_even_factors_sum += factor\n            \n    return total_even_factors_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "def Find_Min(lists):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sublist with the minimum length from a list of lists.\n    If multiple sublists have the same minimum length, the first one encountered is returned.\n    \"\"\"\n    best_sublist = None\n    min_length = float('inf')\n\n    for sublist in lists:\n        current_length = len(sublist)\n        if current_length < min_length:\n            min_length = current_length\n            best_sublist = sublist\n    return best_sublist"}
