{"task_id": "Mbpp/630", "solution": "def get_coordinates(coord: tuple[int, int]) -> list[list[int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Extracts all 8 adjacent coordinates plus the given coordinate, forming a 3x3 block.\n    The coordinates are returned in row-major order (dx outer, dy inner).\n    \"\"\"\n    x, y = coord\n    adjacent_coords = []\n    VALID_DELTA = (-1, 0, 1)\n\n    for dx in VALID_DELTA:\n        for dy in VALID_DELTA:\n            adjacent_coords.append([x + dx, y + dy])\n\n    return adjacent_coords"}
